### Run test remotely
# @timeout 120
POST http://77.234.215.138:34321/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceName": "{{serviceName}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "ratePerSecond": 3,
  "testCount": 1050,
  "processingTimeMillis": 26000,
  "runits": 90
}

### Stop running test to save credits
# @timeout 120
POST http://77.234.215.138:31234/test/stop/{{serviceName}}




